# Keep every text file LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Several gates assert exact file contents (cordis.patch.yml, client.js) and would otherwise fail
# on a Windows checkout where git's autocrlf turns those files into CRLF — the same files that are
# published and verified on Linux. Normalising removes that whole class of false failures.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
